            as today for the section-specific half. It must not re-implement the
            prefix chain beside the shared function.
        readLatestReviewVerdict
          → readLedgerWrapper; map absent-no-file → { state: "absent" };
            unreadable → { state: "invalid", code, detail };
            ok → existing Verdicts walk on wrapper.
        listReviewVerdicts / readGateDecisions
