      null helper return a result type while leaving the surface as a parallel
      re-implementation is the defect in remission — two chains that can still
      disagree on e.g. invalid-root-tag.

      Why not force gates through readLedgerVerdictsSurface itself: that API's ok
      payload is Verdicts[], not a wrapper, and cannot serve Decisions. The shared
      primitive is the wrapper-classification prefix; section walks stay local.

